Description: Isolate generic Wine frame themes from native Linux decorations
 Adapt the reviewed prototype windows-titlebars and frame-selection changes to
 this distribution's native SSD implementation. Keep theme lifetime, font,
 button hitboxes and late class updates per view. Square Windows frames are
 the foundation for a separate caption/rounded-client follow-up.
Origin: other, prototype 26bad17cef413d26c36c117f2f1123dca4edded7
Author: Karyo Developers
